sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Client
    participant R as ResponsesHandler
    participant T as ToolRegistry
    participant P as promptbuilder_process
    participant S as SessionManager
    C->>R: POST /v1/responses
    R->>R: 识别 direct_tool
    R->>T: 校验工具白名单
    T-->>R: 校验结果
    R->>P: keywords/brand/top_k
    P->>P: 生成并聚类 Prompt
    P-->>R: 结构化 JSON
    R->>S: 持久化调用记录
    R-->>C: 工具执行结果
